	measure 'Masked Email' = ```
			
			VAR FullEmail = [email_address]
			VAR AtPosition = FIND("@", FullEmail, 1)
			VAR NamePart = LEFT(FullEmail, AtPosition - 1)
			VAR DomainPart = MID(FullEmail, AtPosition, LEN(FullEmail) - AtPosition + 1)
			VAR MaskedName = 
			    IF(
			        LEN(NamePart) > 5, 
			        LEFT(NamePart, 5) & REPT("*", LEN(NamePart) - 5), 
			        NamePart
			    )
			RETURN
			MaskedName & DomainPart
			```
		lineageTag: 6756742f-37a8-47a2-ae94-53c299f2eaa5

